  "finding": "Change-point localization is useful as a descriptive alarm but its use for cutting history failed the predeclared decision target. SG047 produced 21 fewer covered slopes and 1644 more loss than frozen SG046; abrupt correlation-switch coverage deteriorated from 64/80 to 53/80. Early shift at continuation t=0 cannot be localized within only continuation observations.",
